# SpendFlow Email Delivery Configuration

# OPTION 1 (Recommended & Fast): Resend API Key
# 1. Sign up at https://resend.com (free, 30 seconds)
# 2. Click "API Keys" -> "Create API Key"
# 3. Paste the key below (starts with re_):
RESEND_API_KEY=re_123456789abcdef012345678

# OPTION 2 (Alternative): Gmail SMTP
# GMAIL_USER=your_email@gmail.com
# GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=abcd efgh ijkl mnop
